UPDATE `oc_product_description` SET `description`='&lt;div class=&quot;codecart-product-description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;🚀 &lt;strong&gt;UTF8MB4 Converter PRO&lt;/strong&gt; is a professional CodeCart PRO module for OpenCart 3.0.x and ocStore 3.0.x.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;UTF8MB4 Converter PRO&lt;/strong&gt; audits the store database and safely migrates it from legacy utf8/utf8mb3 to utf8mb4.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;💡 Why you need it&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Emoji and rare characters are stored correctly in texts, names and reviews, and tables are brought to the modern InnoDB engine.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;💎 Key features&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;✅ Diagnostics of database, table, column and connection encoding&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;✅ Checks of MySQL/MariaDB version, collations and table engines&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;✅ Batch conversion queue: pause, resume, stop, progress&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;✅ Table conversion to InnoDB as a separate confirmed action&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;✅ Monitoring of new tables created by third-party extensions&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;✅ Language-file check for BOM, broken UTF-8, control and hidden characters&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;✅ Reversible OCMOD that connects OpenCart through utf8mb4 without editing core files&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;✅ Tables of other projects in the same database are listed separately and never changed&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;🧭 How it works&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1️⃣ Run diagnostics and read the report&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;2️⃣ Make a backup and start the conversion queue&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;3️⃣ Convert tables to InnoDB and check the language files&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;🔐 Good to know&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;✅ ALTER TABLE can block writes — run it at low-traffic hours.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;✅ Characters already damaged into question marks cannot be restored automatically.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;✅ The module is OFF after install.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;✅ Back up your site files and database before installing or updating.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;✅ You can see the module in action in the demo admin before buying.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;⚙️ Compatibility and technology&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;✅ OpenCart 3.0.x&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;✅ ocStore 3.0.x, including 3.0.4.1&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;✅ utf8mb4&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;✅ InnoDB&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;✅ MySQL · MariaDB&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;🌍 Three-language interface&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;The module admin is available in Russian, Ukrainian and English — convenient for stores and teams working in different language environments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;🏆 Summary&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;UTF8MB4 Converter PRO&lt;/strong&gt; is a CodeCart PRO solution for OpenCart and ocStore stores. Details and test access are in the demo admin below.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ccp-demo&quot; style=&quot;background:#eef7ff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;border-radius:14px;padding:18px 20px;margin-top:24px;color:#0b1b3a&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 10px;color:#0b4fa5;&quot;&gt;🧪 Try the module on the demo site&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Before buying you can open the test admin panel and look at the interface and logic of the available modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Demo admin:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://demo.codecartpro.com/admin/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;https://demo.codecartpro.com/admin/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;👤 &lt;strong&gt;Login:&lt;/strong&gt; Demo&lt;br&gt;🔑 &lt;strong&gt;Password:&lt;/strong&gt; Demo&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:0;&quot;&gt;&lt;small&gt;The demo site is for evaluation. The set of installed modules and test data may change.&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ccp-buy-channels&quot; style=&quot;background:#fff8e6;border:1px solid #eed493;border-radius:14px;padding:20px 22px;margin:22px 0;color:#3d2e00&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 10px;color:#8b6100;&quot;&gt;🛒 Where to buy&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;&quot;&gt;CodeCart