RL Generator FREE — безкоштовний базовий інструмент для зрозумілих SEO URL та окремих редиректів в OpenCart/ocStore. Для магазинів, яким потрібен легкий…' WHERE `product_id`=98 AND `language_id`=1;
UPDATE `oc_product_description` SET `description`='&lt;div class=&quot;codecart-product-description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;🚀 &lt;strong&gt;SEO URL Generator FREE&lt;/strong&gt; is a professional CodeCart PRO module for OpenCart 3.0.x and ocStore 3.0.x.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SEO URL Generator FREE&lt;/strong&gt; is a free basic tool for clean SEO URLs and individual redirects in OpenCart/ocStore.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;💡 Why you need it&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;It is for stores that need a lightweight URL generator without the full automation of the paid SEO URL PRO.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;💎 Key features&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;✅ SEO URL generation for products, categories, manufacturers and other entities&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;✅ Custom redirects for products, categories and manufacturers — when an item needs a different link&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;✅ An option to refresh the old SEO URL when an entity’s name changes&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;✅ Compatibility: CodeCart 3.0.5.2, OpenCart 3.x, ocStore 3.0.4.1, PHP 7.4–8.5&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;✅ Strict OFF mode: UniShop2 News events are created only after manual enabling&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;✅ Free; for mass generation across hundreds of products and diagnostics there is SEO URL PRO&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;🧭 How it works&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1️⃣ Install and enable the module&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;2️⃣ Open a product or category and generate the SEO URL&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;3️⃣ When an address changes, add a redirect&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;🔐 Good to know&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;✅ The free version does not replace the mass generation and extended diagnostics of SEO URL PRO.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;✅ Back up your site files and database before installing or updating.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;✅ You can see the module in action in the demo admin before buying.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;⚙️ Compatibility and technology&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;✅ OpenCart 3.0.x&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;✅ ocStore 3.0.x, including 3.0.4.1&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;✅ Free&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;✅ Redirects&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;✅ PHP 7.4–8.5&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;🌍 Three-language interface&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;The module admin is available in Russian, Ukrainian and English — convenient for stores and teams working in different language environments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;🏆 Summary&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SEO URL Generator FREE&lt;/strong&gt; is a CodeCart PRO solution for OpenCart and ocStore stores. Details and test access are in the demo admin below.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ccp-demo&quot; style=&quot;background:#eef7ff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;border-radius:14px;padding:18px 20px;margin-top:24px;color:#0b1b3a&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 10px;color:#0b4fa5;&quot;&gt;🧪 Try the module on the demo site&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Before buying you can open the test admin panel and look at the interface and logic of the available modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Demo admin:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://demo.codecartpro.com/admin/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;https://demo.codecartpro.com/admin/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;👤 &lt;strong&gt;Login:&lt;/strong&gt; Demo&lt;br&gt;🔑 &lt;strong&gt;Password:&lt;/strong&gt; Demo&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom:0;&quot;&gt;&lt;small&gt;The demo site is for evaluation. The set of installed modules and test data may change.&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;ccp-buy-channels&quot; style=&quot;background:#fff8e6;border:1px solid #eed493;border-radius:14px;padding:20px 22px;margin:22px 0;color:#3d2e00&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 style=&quot;margin:0 0 10px;color:#8b6100;&quot;&gt;🛒 Where to buy&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0;&quot;&gt;CodeCart PRO modules can be purchased on this site. An additional official channel is the &lt;a href=&quot;https://opencartforum.com/files/developer/1123944-codecartpro/?utm_source=opencartforum&amp;amp;utm_medium=profilecpage&amp;amp;utm_campaign=profile&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;CodeCart PRO profile on OpenCartForum&lt;/a&gt;. Check the current version, price and terms of the specific offer before paying.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', `meta_description`='SEO URL Generator FREE is a free basic tool for clean SEO URLs and individual redirects in OpenCart/ocStore. It is for stores that need a lightweight URL…' WHERE `product_id`=98 AND `language_id`=2;
